{"name": "Project DevourSlime", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/8601e2c27a9bd444e007e763feb34ab5.poster.avif?t=1785077995\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/8601e2c27a9bd444e007e763feb34ab5.webm?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/8601e2c27a9bd444e007e763feb34ab5.mp4?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DevourSlimes are strange creatures gifted with extraordinary abilities.When scientists uncover the potential of their species, countless DevourSlimes are captured and taken into laboratories for research.Then everything goes wrong.A toxic gas leak spreads through the facility.The scientists flee.You are left behind\u2014seemingly the only surviving DevourSlime.Or are you?As you fight to escape, you begin to realize that the truth behind the laboratory\u2014and your captivity\u2014is far more complex than it first appeared\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/0c5f1adb822c9b71856b0c7f73b3a21a.poster.avif?t=1785077995\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/0c5f1adb822c9b71856b0c7f73b3a21a.webm?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/0c5f1adb822c9b71856b0c7f73b3a21a.mp4?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project DevourSlime is a precision platformer with puzzle elements, built around <strong>[VERSATILE MECHANICS]</strong>.Use your abilities to <strong>[ABSORD PLATFORMS], [SHOOT THEM OUT]</strong>, and <strong>[DIVE INTO THEM]</strong> to solve puzzles, fight enemies, and perform high-speed platforming challenges.Platforms are a limited resource, requiring careful resource management as you <strong>[plan your own unique and creative routes through each level].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/33717be934f119072a19d99782ffaef4.poster.avif?t=1785077995\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/33717be934f119072a19d99782ffaef4.webm?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/33717be934f119072a19d99782ffaef4.mp4?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"140\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/7e7096e99cd4b241fc6242f26b9cd366.poster.avif?t=1785077995\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/7e7096e99cd4b241fc6242f26b9cd366.mp4?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With stage results and a wide range of achievements, the game challenges you to <strong>[push your limits]</strong>\u2014experimenting with unconventional paths, faster completion times, and more efficient resource usage.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b0f29cbe3ab1a2bd8415081d800bc065.poster.avif?t=1785077995\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b0f29cbe3ab1a2bd8415081d800bc065.webm?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/extras/b0f29cbe3ab1a2bd8415081d800bc065.mp4?t=1785077995\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A platformer\u2026 but you can take the platforms with you!?Control DevourSlime and solve puzzles by absorbing and shooting out the platforms near you.Battle corrupted lab machinery and hostile contaminants, stay ahead of the toxic gas, and rescue your companions.Plan your own unique escape route!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263880/200a10bc10a8c9740e7b868476c9252d8c282e69/header.jpg?t=1785077995", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Platformer", "2D Platformer", "Precision Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Pixel Graphics", "Action"], "developers": "StrangeWave Studio", "publishers": "StrangeWave Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3263880", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tKbm0xPd_ZU", "first_seen": 1771714800.0, "review_rank": 1126}